{
  "id": 119454563,
  "iid": 4381,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Show error for -X lua_script if no Lua support",
  "description": "Wireshark/tshark may be built without Lua support. This patch adds an\nerror message if the user specifies the `-X lua_script` command-line\nargument to a program built without Lua support, so the user is not left\nwondering why their script isn't working.\n\n(Cherry picked from commit d3d4e4b1)",
